@keyframes fadeOut {
  from {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  to {
    opacity: 0;
  }
}
What do you suppose happens if we omit one of these blocks? For example, what if we only specify the ending point?
@keyframes fadeToTransparent {
  to {
    opacity: 0;
